---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Rivalo Privacy Policy">
  <LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" updated="June 2, 2026">
    <p>Rivalo tracks football performance while keeping data focused on the app experience.</p>
    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Account information used for sign-in and profile setup.</li>
      <li>Workout metrics such as duration, distance, heart rate, sprints, calories, and route samples when you record a match.</li>
      <li>Match context you choose to add, such as score, opponent, competition, position, surface, and court.</li>
      <li>Local photos or venue notes you add inside the app.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use data</h2>
    <p>We use your data to provide match summaries, personal records, goals, streaks, rivalries, court stats, and performance insights.</p>
    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell personal data. Data is only shared with service providers required to run the app, such as authentication, database, hosting, and Apple platform services.</p>
    <h2>Health data</h2>
    <p>Apple Health data is used only to record and display your football activity. It is not used for advertising or sold to third parties.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy requests, contact support@rivalo.app.</p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
